<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
  />
  <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />

  <title>HumanKey Protocol | Hash Humanity</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Learn how HumanKey uses liveness, biometric uniqueness checks, privacy-preserving proofs, and passkeys to support one human, one account on Hash Humanity."
  />

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large" />

  <link rel="icon" href="logo.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="logo.png" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #000;
      --text: #f5f5f7;
      --muted: #a1a1a6;
      --dim: #6e6e73;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --line-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      --surface: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      --max: 1180px;
      --reading: 780px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      background: #000;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      color: var(--text);

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 50% -4%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.065),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        #000;

      font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "SF Pro Display",
        "SF Pro Text",
        "Helvetica Neue",
        Arial,
        sans-serif;

      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    button,
    a {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);

      background: rgba(0,0,0,.76);

      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(140%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(140%);

      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);
    }

    .header-inner {
      height: 62px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 27px;
      height: 27px;
      object-fit: contain;

      filter:
        grayscale(1)
        brightness(0)
        invert(1);

      background: transparent !important;
      border: 0 !important;
      border-radius: 0 !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .lang-switch {
      position: relative;
    }

    .lang-btn {
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: #d4d4d8;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
      padding: 8px 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .lang-menu {
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(100% + 10px);
      right: 0;
      min-width: 155px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 8px;
      display: none;
      list-style: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(18,18,20,.97);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
      z-index: 1200;
    }

    .header-link {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      color: #d1d1d5;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 550;
    }

    .header-enter {
      min-height: 35px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.055);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: 136px;
      padding-bottom: 70px;
    }

    .eyebrow,
    .section-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #99999f;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,255,255,.75);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(62px, 8vw, 108px);
      line-height: .91;
      letter-spacing: -.067em;
      font-weight: 680;
    }

    .hero h1 em {
      color: #7d7d82;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 560;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 28px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.7vw, 22px);
      line-height: 1.5;
      letter-spacing: -.022em;
    }

    .hero-lead strong {
      color: #f3f3f5;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .core,
    .ratio-section,
    .flow-section,
    .biometrics,
    .privacy,
    .passkey,
    .recovery,
    .security,
    .limits {
      padding: 62px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .core-grid,
    .passkey-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.35fr;
      gap: 50px;
    }

    .core h2,
    .section-heading,
    .passkey h2 {
      margin: 15px 0 0;
      max-width: 800px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.052em;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .core h2 em,
    .passkey h2 em {
      color: #7f7f84;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .core p,
    .section-intro,
    .biometric-lead {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 20px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .ratio {
      margin: 18px 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(100px, 19vw, 230px);
      line-height: .82;
      letter-spacing: -.09em;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .ratio-labels {
      max-width: 610px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: #76767b;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .ratio-copy {
      max-width: 730px;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .ratio-copy h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 4.6vw, 62px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.05em;
    }

    .ratio-copy p {
      margin: 20px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .flow {
      margin-top: 38px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .flow-step {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 70px 250px 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 27px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .step-number {
      color: #66666b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .flow-step h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 620;
      letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }

    .flow-step p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .biometric-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 38px;
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,.035),
          rgba(255,255,255,.012)
        );
    }

    .info-card h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 620;
      letter-spacing: -.025em;
    }

    .info-card p {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .privacy-statement {
      max-width: 970px;
      margin: 17px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 84px);
      line-height: .96;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .privacy-statement em {
      color: #77777c;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .privacy-copy {
      max-width: 740px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .privacy-copy p,
    .passkey-copy p,
    .limits-copy p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .passkey-copy {
      padding-top: 25px;
    }

    .recovery-box {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 90% 0%,
          rgba(255,255,255,.06),
          transparent 28%
        ),
        rgba(255,255,255,.02);
    }

    .recovery-box h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .recovery-box p {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .security-list {
      margin-top: 34px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .security-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
      gap: 35px;
      padding: 23px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .security-row strong {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 620;
    }

    .security-row span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .limits h2 {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(45px, 5.8vw, 78px);
      line-height: .97;
      letter-spacing: -.058em;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .limits h2 em {
      color: #77777c;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .limits-copy {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .final {
      padding: 72px 0 62px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .final h2 {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 15px auto 0;
      font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 94px);
      line-height: .91;
      letter-spacing: -.067em;
    }

    .final h2 em {
      color: #7c7c81;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .final p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 23px auto 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .final-actions {
      margin-top: 27px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 46px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding:
        22px 0
        calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: #77777c;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .wrap {
        width: calc(100% - 24px);
      }

      .header-inner {
        height: 56px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .brand img {
        width: 25px;
        height: 25px;
      }

      .header-link {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 94px;
        padding-bottom: 46px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        max-width: 590px;
        font-size: clamp(51px, 14vw, 76px);
      }

      .hero-lead {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .core,
      .ratio-section,
      .flow-section,
      .biometrics,
      .privacy,
      .passkey,
      .recovery,
      .security,
      .limits {
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .core-grid,
      .passkey-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .core h2,
      .section-heading,
      .passkey h2 {
        font-size: clamp(39px, 10.5vw, 55px);
      }

      .core p,
      .section-intro,
      .biometric-lead {
        margin-top: 17px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .ratio {
        font-size: clamp(100px, 34vw, 155px);
      }

      .flow {
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .flow-step {
        grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 22px 0;
      }

      .flow-step p {
        grid-column: 2;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .flow-step h3 {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .biometric-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .privacy-statement {
        font-size: clamp(43px, 11.5vw, 60px);
      }

      .passkey-copy {
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      .security-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 20px 0;
      }

      .final {
        padding: 52px 0 48px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 430px) {
      .wrap {
        width: calc(100% - 18px);
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 86px;
        padding-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(47px, 13.5vw, 60px);
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 330px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap header-inner">

      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <img src="logo.png" alt="Hash Humanity logo" />
        <span>Hash Humanity</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="header-actions">

        <div class="lang-switch">
          <button
            class="lang-btn"
            id="langBtn"
            type="button"
            aria-haspopup="listbox"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >
            <span id="langBtnLabel">EN</span>
          </button>

          <ul
            class="lang-menu"
            id="langMenu"
            role="listbox"
            aria-label="Language selection"
          ></ul>
        </div>

        <a
          class="header-link"
          href="mission.html"
          data-i18n="nav_mission"
        >
          Mission
        </a>

        <a
          class="header-enter"
          href="https://hashhumanity.world/universe"
          data-i18n="nav_enter"
        >
          Enter
        </a>

      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>


  <main>

    <section class="hero wrap">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
        <span data-i18n="eyebrow">HUMANKEY PROTOCOL</span>
      </div>

      <h1 data-i18n-html="h1">
        Prove you are human.<br />
        <em>Not who you are.</em>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lead" data-i18n-html="lead">
        HumanKey is the proof-of-personhood system behind Hash Humanity.
        It combines liveness detection, biometric uniqueness checks,
        privacy-preserving account controls, and passkeys to support one
        simple rule: <strong>one human, one account.</strong>
      </p>

    </section>


    <section class="core">
      <div class="wrap core-grid">

        <div>
          <span class="section-label" data-i18n="what_label">
            WHAT HUMANKEY DOES
          </span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 data-i18n-html="what_h2">
            We need to know that you are a person.
            <em>We do not need your public identity.</em>
          </h2>

          <p data-i18n="what_p">
            Most websites prove that someone controls an email address,
            phone number, password, or device. That does not prove that
            every account belongs to a different human being.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="ratio-section">
      <div class="wrap">

        <span class="section-label" data-i18n="rule_label">
          THE RULE
        </span>

        <div class="ratio">1:1</div>

        <div class="ratio-labels">
          <span data-i18n="one_human">ONE HUMAN</span>
          <span data-i18n="one_account">ONE ACCOUNT</span>
        </div>

        <div class="ratio-copy">

          <h2 data-i18n="rule_h2">
            Another email should not mean another identity.
          </h2>

          <p data-i18n="rule_p">
            Creating another email address is easy. Creating another
            username is easy. Software can automate both. HumanKey is
            designed so that creating another account requires another
            unique human being, not simply another credential.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="flow-section">
      <div class="wrap">

        <span class="section-label" data-i18n="flow_label">
          HOW IT WORKS
        </span>

        <h2 class="section-heading" data-i18n="flow_h2">
          From person to HumanKey.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-intro" data-i18n="flow_p">
          HumanKey separates proof of personhood from everyday
          authentication. The biometric process establishes human
          uniqueness during enrollment. After enrollment, the account
          can use a passkey for normal authentication.
        </p>

        <div class="flow">

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">01</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step1_h">Consent</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step1_p">
              Biometric processing begins only after the user is shown
              the HumanKey process and provides consent.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">02</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step2_h">Liveness</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step2_p">
              The user completes a liveness session. The purpose is to
              determine whether the camera is seeing a live participant
              rather than simply accepting a photograph or basic replay.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">03</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step3_h">Face representation</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step3_p">
              A mathematical facial representation is created or obtained
              for biometric comparison.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">04</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step4_h">Uniqueness search</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step4_p">
              The new enrollment is checked against previously enrolled
              biometric records to determine whether the same person
              appears to have already enrolled.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">05</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step5_h">HumanKey established</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step5_p">
              When the required checks pass, the account satisfies
              HumanKey's proof-of-personhood requirements.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">06</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step6_h">Passkey created</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step6_p">
              The user creates a passkey for everyday authentication.
              HumanKey does not need to perform a new facial uniqueness
              scan every time the person signs in.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <span class="step-number">07</span>
            <h3 data-i18n="step7_h">Enter Hash Humanity</h3>
            <p data-i18n="step7_p">
           